  "question": "Where’s the closest gallery reachable in the north direction from I-20 Wildlife Preserve, Midland, TX?",
  "sql": "SELECT P.poi_name FROM pois AS P, ( SELECT geometry FROM parks WHERE park_name ILIKE '%I-20 Wildlife Preserve%' LIMIT 1 ) AS Origin WHERE P.tourism = 'gallery' AND ( degrees(ST_Azimuth(Origin.geometry :: geography, P.geometry :: geography)) BETWEEN 337.5 AND 360 OR degrees(ST_Azimuth(Origin.geometry :: geography, P.geometry :: geography)) BETWEEN 0 AND 22.5 ) ORDER BY ST_Distance(Origin.geometry :: geography, P.geometry :: geography) ASC LIMIT 1;",
